        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@mehalter, I've finally reached the point of having mental capacity to review this PR. Sorry it took so long.\r\n\r\nMy original plan for even adding \"lsp\" category was for it to have effect on 'mini.completion'. After studying the code of 'onsails/lspkind.nvim', I've noticed that it plainly overrides `vim.lsp.protocol.CompletionItemKind` and it seems to work. As this map is also used in 'mini.completion', this was a good sign.\r\n\r\nIn the end, I opted for adding a specific `MiniIcons.tweak_lsp_kind()` and tie it to 'mini.completion'. All other parts of 'onsails/lspkind.nvim' are either straightforward to implement manually (`M.symbolic()`) or rather out of scope for 'mini.icons' (`M.cmp_format()`, as only single line concerns icons while the rest are convenience wrappers for formatting completion item).\r\n\r\nI appreciate the work you've put into this PR, but I am afraid it won't get merged in favor of functionality already present in `main`. Thanks for the effort!",
            "created_at": "2024-07-30T15:56:52Z",
